This crate is an independent Rust implementation of the Laya decision-model
architecture.

Behavioral and architectural reference:
- sys1 0.0.3, Copyright Alvaro Bartolome, Apache-2.0
  https://github.com/alvarobartt/sys1
- Official Laya repository (Convai Innovations), Apache-2.0
  https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya

No model weights are included. Model weights are downloaded by the user or by
the sys1 hub and remain subject to their own licenses.
